{"id":"n40540-1-8","stage":5,"title":"다방면 · 多方","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40540-1-8-1","ko":"민준이가 다방면으로 재능을 가지고 있더라.","zh":"敏俊在很多方面都很有天赋呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"다방면으로","meaning":"多方，各方面","explanation":"다방면：多方，各方面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"다방면","audio":"/audio/48b0ad337d9e47f8d796.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40540","senseId":"1","lemma":"다방면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다방면으로","audio":"/audio/d150c819fedca6b40545.mp3"}},{"text":"재능을","meaning":"才能","explanation":"재능：才能；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재능","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24909","senseId":"1","lemma":"재능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재능을","audio":"/audio/a89d999074e86bc42f9b.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"拥有，具有，持有","explanation":"가지다：拥有，具有，持有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"5","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"있더라.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있더라","audio":"/audio/db6e6dea1cff19be66a6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"48b0ad337d9e47f8","term":"다방면","zh":"多方，各方面","audio":"/audio/48b0ad337d9e47f8d796.mp3","entryId":"40540","definition":"多个方面。","pronunciation":["다방면"]},{"id":"9b24886d36def3ca","term":"재능","zh":"才能","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3","entryId":"24909","definition":"做好某事的才干和能力。","pronunciation":["재능"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"拥有，具有，持有","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"具备可以发挥的效力或能力等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac48e5bf1b9c7ec4bc2a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40540-1-8-2","ko":"응. 그 녀석은 운동에 공부에 요리까지 못하는 것이 없어.","zh":"对啊，那家伙无论是运动、学习还是做饭，没有他做不来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"他","explanation":"그：他","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"녀석은","meaning":"家伙","explanation":"녀석：家伙；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"녀석","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41586","senseId":"1","lemma":"녀석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"녀석은","audio":"/audio/5dd47992235e0f08503f.mp3"}},{"text":"운동에","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동에","audio":"/audio/fa55b66f3f79db57b952.mp3"}},{"text":"공부에","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audi